<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.19 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.19 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 6.19 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Nov 13			9,900</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Nov		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to Nov 10			   6,866</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,189</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
